{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34282","headline":"迎潮送潮辞 送潮 · 陆龟蒙","name":"迎潮送潮辞 送潮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潮西来兮又东下，日染中流兮红洒洒。\n汀葭苍兮屿蓼枯，风骚牢兮愁烟孤。\n大几望兮微将晦翳，睨瀛溶兮敛然而退。\n爱长波兮数数，一幅巾兮无缨可濯。\n帆生尘兮檝有衣，怅潮之还兮吾犹未归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}